>pMin_backbone len=2214 source=pBB027_pMin-ccdb (2695 bp, circular) the ccdB cassette between the two BsaI sites is replaced by the library insert during Golden Gate cloning, so the retained sequence below is what EVERY library member carries. It is written starting at the right flank and ending at the left flank, i.e. reading away from the insert and back round to it; it is NOT circular on its own, the insert closes it.
